{"id":"5b4c86c70dd29331","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-embedding-amalgamation.md","title":"Amalgamation Property for Ordinary Embeddings","display":"df-embedding-amalgamation — Amalgamation Property for Ordinary Embeddings","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-embedding-amalgamation","aliases":["17-df-embedding-amalgamation"],"display":"df-embedding-amalgamation — Amalgamation Property for Ordinary Embeddings","depends_on":["[[17-df-model]]","[[17-df-embedding]]"],"label_origin":"local-descriptive-label","source_section":"3.5","source_result":"Unnumbered amalgamation-property definition preceding Proposition 3.5.11","source_pages_print":[195,196],"source_pages_djvu":[211,212],"source_verification":"definition compared in supplied DjVu OCR; ordinary versus elementary embeddings distinguished","verification_date":"2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-embedding-amalgamation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-embedding-amalgamation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-embedding-amalgamation — Amalgamation Property for Ordinary Embeddings"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3482e8f05d02c6f0\" href=\"?note=3482e8f05d02c6f0\" title=\"17-df-embedding\">17-df-embedding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-descriptive-label"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.5"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Unnumbered amalgamation-property definition preceding Proposition 3.5.11"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>195</span><span>196</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>211</span><span>212</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"definition compared in supplied DjVu OCR; ordinary versus elementary embeddings distinguished"},{"key":"verification_date","html":"2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3482e8f05d02c6f0\" href=\"?note=3482e8f05d02c6f0\" title=\"17-df-embedding\">17-df-embedding</a> 的普通结构嵌入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\">\\(\\circ\\)</span> 为集合函数的复合。\n以下定义理论的一元谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)\\)</span>。所有结构量词都是 ZFC 元语言中的量词，模型类是可定义元类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak C\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\\forall f\\;\\forall g\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\land\n\\operatorname{Emb}_L(g,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak C)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\mathfrak D\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\\exists h\\;\\exists k\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Emb}_L(h,\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak D)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Emb}_L(k,\\mathfrak C,\\mathfrak D)\n\\land h\\circ f=k\\circ g\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak C\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\\forall f\\;\\forall g\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\land\n\\operatorname{Emb}_L(g,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak C)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\mathfrak D\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\\exists h\\;\\exists k\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Emb}_L(h,\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak D)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Emb}_L(k,\\mathfrak C,\\mathfrak D)\n\\land h\\circ f=k\\circ g\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷 pp.195–196、DjVu 211–212 的 amalgamation property 使用普通嵌入。本节点以理论为参数，适用于任意大小的模型。</p>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7ba09ad1e61f0c97\" href=\"?note=7ba09ad1e61f0c97\" title=\"17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property\">17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AP}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{AP}_L\\)</span> 使用初等嵌入；两者的映射资格不同，不能直接把它用在模型完备化判据中。<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc4d04472af291f6\" href=\"?note=fc4d04472af291f6\" title=\"17-df-fraisse-class\">17-df-fraisse-class</a> 中的有限结构应用也不替代本条的全模型量化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"3482e8f05d02c6f0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。\n$\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 为 [[17-df-embedding]] 的普通结构嵌入；$\\circ$ 为集合函数的复合。\n以下定义理论的一元谓词 $\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)$。所有结构量词都是 ZFC 元语言中的量词，模型类是可定义元类。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"3482e8f05d02c6f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。\n$\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 为 [[17-df-embedding]] 的普通结构嵌入；$\\circ$ 为集合函数的复合。\n以下定义理论的一元谓词 $\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)$。所有结构量词都是 ZFC 元语言中的量词，模型类是可定义元类。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property","status":"resolved","id":"7ba09ad1e61f0c97","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property]] 的 $\\operatorname{AP}_L$ 使用初等嵌入；两者的映射资格不同，不能直接把它用在模型完备化判据中。[[17-df-fraisse-class]] 中的有限结构应用也不替代本条的全模型量化。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-fraisse-class","status":"resolved","id":"fc4d04472af291f6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property]] 的 $\\operatorname{AP}_L$ 使用初等嵌入；两者的映射资格不同，不能直接把它用在模型完备化判据中。[[17-df-fraisse-class]] 中的有限结构应用也不替代本条的全模型量化。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\;&\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak C\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\\forall f\\;\\forall g\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&\\bigl(\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\land\n\\operatorname{Emb}_L(g,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak C)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists\\mathfrak D\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\\exists h\\;\\exists k\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Emb}_L(h,\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak D)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Emb}_L(k,\\mathfrak C,\\mathfrak D)\n\\land h\\circ f=k\\circ g\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AP}_L","display":false}],"bytes":2117,"backlinks":[{"id":"d868412e4c7fb403","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$、$\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L$ 分别见 [[17-df-model-companion]]、[[17-df-model-completion]]。\n$\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)$ 使用 [[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]] 的普通嵌入。证明中图示和完全性分别取 [[17-df-diagram]]、[[17-df-theory-properties]] 的扩张语言实例；使用 [[17-lem-universal-consequences-extension]] 及 [[17-thm-compactness]] 的紧致性。完全理论的两个任意模型的初等联合嵌入在下文直接由紧致性论证。"},{"id":"15698750acc82ec9","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L$ 见 [[17-df-model-completeness]]；$T_\\forall$ 见 [[17-df-universal-consequences]]。\n$\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L$、$\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L$ 分别见 [[17-df-model-completion]]、[[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]]。\n$\\operatorname{QE}_L(T)$ 取 [[17-df-quantifier-elimination]] 的全赋值语义定义；量词自由式允许无用自由变量。"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n